WEBVTT

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:32.621
the pandemic would last about
eight weeks at least.

00:04:32.621 --> 00:04:36.538
Its impact on my life would be, you know,
that was the first thing like, OK,

00:04:36.538 --> 00:04:39.704
everything is canceled in March
and April and maybe May,

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:43.121
but June and July and August
are totally on. Right.

00:04:43.329 --> 00:04:47.329
And then as the weeks passed and I
realized, oh, my gosh, you know,

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:49.788
and I finally, you know, I had to do.

00:04:50.704 --> 00:04:56.496
The thing I have many times advise others
to do when they feel powerless is to

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:59.996
surrender and to accept that's
about accepting what's true,